    "format": "html",
    "html": "<p><img src=\"wong.jpg\" align=\"right\"><i>Here is a series of articles by Master Bullseye Pistol shooter and highly successful Optometrist, Dr. Norman H. Wong, O.D.  I have not met anyone who has not learned a lot from the writings of Dr. Wong, on a topic of particular importance to competitive shooting.</i></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"wong1.htm\">For Eyecare Professionals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"wong2.htm\">ABBE and Shooting Glasses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"wong3.htm\">Inaccuracies in RX Glasses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"wong4.htm\">The 20 Foot Eye Exam</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"wong5.htm\">Red Dot Focus Position</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"wong6.htm\">Obsolete RX for Shooting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"wong7.htm\">Keeping Focused</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"wongbio.htm\">About Dr. Norman Wong</a></li></ul>",
    "text": "Here is a series of articles by Master Bullseye Pistol shooter and highly successful Optometrist, Dr. Norman H. Wong, O.D. I have not met anyone who has not learned a lot from the writings of Dr. Wong, on a topic of particular importance to competitive shooting.\nFor Eyecare Professionals\nABBE and Shooting Glasses\nInaccuracies in RX Glasses\nThe 20 Foot Eye Exam\nRed Dot Focus Position\nObsolete RX for Shooting\nKeeping Focused\nAbout Dr. Norman Wong"
  },
